# Pages serves static files only: it has no /api and no WebSocket, so the app
# cannot sign anyone in from here. The whole app - frontend, API and /ws - runs
# on one origin on Render, so forward every path there and keep the submitted
# link working.
#
# 302, not 301: a permanent redirect gets cached by browsers and would be hard
# to undo if the backend ever moves.
/*    https://dataman-oncocare.onrender.com/:splat    302
